    "12 included parts. Reading answers and explanations work offline. AI feedback, conversations and new audio need internet." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "يتضمن 12 جزءًا. تعمل إجابات Reading وشروحاتها دون اتصال. تتطلب ملاحظات الذكاء الاصطناعي والمحادثات والصوت الجديد اتصالًا بالإنترنت."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "12 included parts. Reading answers and explanations work offline. AI feedback, conversations and new audio need internet."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Incluye 12 partes. Las respuestas y explicaciones de Reading funcionan sin conexión. Los comentarios de IA, las conversaciones y el audio nuevo requieren internet."
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "12 भाग शामिल हैं। Reading के उत्तर और व्याख्याएँ ऑफ़लाइन उपलब्ध हैं। AI प्रतिक्रिया, बातचीत और नए ऑडियो के लिए इंटरनेट चाहिए।"
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tersedia 12 bagian. Jawaban dan penjelasan Reading dapat digunakan offline. Umpan balik AI, percakapan, dan audio baru memerlukan internet."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "全12パートを収録。Readingの採点・解説はオフラインで利用できます。AI講評・会話・新しい音声の生成には通信が必要です。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "12개 파트가 포함되어 있습니다. Reading 정답과 해설은 오프라인으로 이용할 수 있습니다. AI 피드백, 대화, 새 음성 생성에는 인터넷이 필요합니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Inclui 12 partes. Respostas e explicações de Reading funcionam offline. Feedback de IA, conversas e novos áudios precisam de internet."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "มีเนื้อหา 12 พาร์ต คำตอบและคำอธิบาย Reading ใช้งานออฟไลน์ได้ ข้อเสนอแนะจาก AI การสนทนา และเสียงใหม่ต้องใช้อินเทอร์เน็ต"
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Có sẵn 12 phần. Đáp án và giải thích Reading dùng được ngoại tuyến. Nhận xét AI, hội thoại và âm thanh mới cần internet."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "内置12个部分。阅读答案和解析可离线使用。AI反馈、对话和新音频需要联网。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "內建12個部分。閱讀答案和解析可離線使用。AI講評、對話及新音訊需要連線。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
