    "Writing・Speakingの講評後に全体の学習用推定を表示します。発音の評価は含みません。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "يظهر التقدير العام بعد تقييم الكتابة والمحادثة. لا يُقيّم النطق."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your overall learning estimate appears after Writing and Speaking feedback. Pronunciation is not assessed."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La estimación global aparece después de los comentarios de Writing y Speaking. No se evalúa la pronunciación."
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Writing और Speaking के मूल्यांकन के बाद कुल अनुमान दिखेगा। उच्चारण नहीं आँका जाता।"
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Perkiraan keseluruhan muncul setelah penilaian Writing dan Speaking. Pelafalan tidak dinilai."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Writing・Speakingの講評後に全体の学習用推定を表示します。発音の評価は含みません。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Writing과 Speaking 평가 후 전체 추정치를 표시합니다. 발음은 평가하지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A estimativa geral aparece após a avaliação de Writing e Speaking. A pronúncia não é avaliada."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ค่าประมาณรวมจะแสดงหลังประเมินการเขียนและการพูด ไม่ประเมินการออกเสียง"
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ước tính tổng thể xuất hiện sau nhận xét Writing và Speaking. Không đánh giá phát âm."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "完成写作和口语评价后将显示总体参考等级。不含发音评价。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "完成寫作和口語評價後將顯示總體參考等級。不含發音評價。"
          }
        }
      }
